    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used an AI tutor app during my physics course to review calculus concepts. It broke down problems into simple steps and gave me instant feedback. It helped me visualize functions and derivatives. I found it especially useful for checking my work after trying to solve problems myself. The experience was positive—accessible, non-judgmental, and helpful without being overwhelming.",
